WEBVTT

00:06:28.892 --> 00:06:31.313
with the challenges of growing food

00:06:31.337 --> 00:06:33.182
as the climate changes.

00:06:34.193 --> 00:06:37.018
There is life force in cultivation.

00:06:37.947 --> 00:06:39.586
At last count,

00:06:39.610 --> 00:06:44.639
130 million girls are still denied
their basic right to attend school.

00:06:45.234 --> 00:06:48.345
Gaps are greatest
in secondary school classrooms.

00:06:48.979 --> 00:06:52.887
Too many girls are missing
a vital foundation for life.

00:06:53.599 --> 00:06:57.418
Education means better health
for women and their children,

00:06:57.989 --> 00:06:59.601
better financial security,